{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:16 2026-11-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:16 2026-11-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:16 2026-11-13 HKT</p><img alt=\"新世界開市前停牌 市場關注股東注資\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/66338e6ec968d689c559fd3918a58b8f/2026-11/NW.png\"/><p>新世界（017）在早上8時45分公布短暫停牌，以待刊發內幕消息。</p><p>近期市場關注，新世界推進資本重組的工作，包括潛在供股。上月有報道指，私募股權公司貝恩資本（Bain Capital）正探討向新世界注資，該方案包括鄭氏家族亦會注入新資金。而過去黑石集團亦曾研究注資方案，但有傳因鄭氏家族拒絕交出控股權而作罷。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:33:25.706330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:16:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T01:37:21.727223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:26:54.490754+00:00","content_hash":"1e18f262ee6beffe5a8bdba826e4de8d5ea9e22271e01568e525c1210349db49","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}